# C06 theme draft request read — manage link closed

Issue: https://github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-remote-ops/issues/5
Repo: github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-ios
Branch: cursor/c06-theme-draft-request-read-e504
Base: cursor/c06-author-page-read-e504 @ b0e203e927792679dab705a0801e54e213e7dc13

The exclusive caller is `MerchantNPCThemeDraftRequestRead`. It sends
GET `api/ai/theme/draft/request?requestId=` using the request id already held on
`MerchantNPCKnowledgeAuthorFlow` and the logged-in member token. A hit is passed
into `recoverFromDraftRead` only when the returned request id and member id match.
`NOT_FOUND` or a mismatch leaves the phase unchanged and does not publish.
The caller does not POST `api/ai/theme/draft`, does not call `publishApproved`,
and does not invent a request id. An invalid request id is rejected before the read.

`MerchantOperationsEditor.submitAuthoredFields` is not rewritten. The character
page is not replaced. `draftRead` on that page stays the injected closure.

